WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.711 --> 00:00:06.945
This page connects SOC122 to your own field of study, whatever you are here to become.

2
00:00:06.945 --> 00:00:17.583
Choose your program lens. Pick your area of study or your exact Seneca program. General stream and Still exploring are real options with their own write-ups.

3
00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:26.917
Read the field write-up. It shows the course's ideas operating in your field's world and gives you a question to carry through the term.

4
00:00:26.917 --> 00:00:37.919
Remember what the lens never changes. The required sources, outcomes, activities, assessments, and grading are identical for every student. The lens changes examples and framing only.

5
00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:46.822
Write the reflection. One honest sentence about where this course already shows up in your field is a seed for assignments later.

6
00:00:46.822 --> 00:00:57.825
Watch the lens follow you. Once chosen, week pages, activities, media cards, and the synthesis page all speak to your field. Turn it off any time by choosing General stream.

7
00:00:57.825 --> 00:01:03.998
The graded curriculum is identical for every student. Nothing on this page is scored.

8
00:01:03.998 --> 00:01:10.691
Where next: Open the current week and watch the field translation appear inside its concepts.
